the tablet's panel: 9 marked moves in view, notes 0 and 2
  a touch on note 0: tip 0, in the safe area, clear of its move
  a tap on settings: tip -1, on the game
  then note 0, then note 2: tip 2
  note 2 again: tip -1
  back with a tip: tip -1, on the game
  the mouse over note 0: tip 0, then away: tip -1; drawn as it came true, at rest false, as it went true, at rest false
